+# Airflow 3.3.2 Deployment Guide
+
+## Pre-Deployment Checklist (This Week)
+
+### 1. Validate Syntax
+```bash
+python -m py_compile dags/ingest_shipments.py
+python -m py_compile dags/carrier_scorecard.py
+```
+✅ Both files compile without errors
+
+### 2. Review Changes
+```bash
+git show HEAD --stat
+# Shows: 4 files changed, 97 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
+```
+Changes documented in MIGRATION_NOTES.md
+
+### 3. Test in Staging (Airflow 3.3.2 environment)
+
+#### Step 1: Deploy code
+```bash
+pip install -r requirements.txt  # apache-airflow==3.3.2
+airflow dags list                # Verify both DAGs registered
+```
+
+#### Step 2: Trigger ingest_shipments manually
+```bash
+airflow dags test ingest_shipments --execution-date 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
+```
+
+Expected outputs:
+- `output/warehouse/shipments/batch_202603020000.csv` created
+- CSV contains header row + event rows
+- XCom key "watermark" present with latest updated_at value
+- Task instance shows 0 retries (success on first try)
+
+#### Step 3: Verify scorecard DAG triggers
+```bash
+airflow dags test carrier_scorecard --execution-date 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
+```
+
+Expected outputs:
+- `output/scorecard/carrier_scorecard.csv` created
+- Columns: [carrier, shipments, delivered, on_time, on_time_rate]
+- `output/scorecard/_READY` file created
+- _READY file contents: `carriers=<N> shipments=<N>`
+
+#### Step 4: Check for duplicate events
+Trigger ingest_shipments again with same data interval:
+```bash
+airflow dags test ingest_shipments --execution-date 2026-03-02T01:00:00Z
+```
+
+Verify:
+- New batch file created: `batch_202603020100.csv`
+- No duplicate events in new batch (watermark filtering works)
+- Old batch still exists: `batch_202603020000.csv`
+
+#### Step 5: Validate scorecard remains consistent
+```bash
+airflow dags test carrier_scorecard --execution-date 2026-03-02T01:00:00Z
+```
+
+Verify:
+- Scorecard updated with latest events from all batches
+- Aggregations correct (latest event per shipment_id)
+- _READY file updated with new counts
+
+### 4. Manual Data Reconciliation
+Work with ops team to confirm:
+- Batch row counts match carrier invoice expectations
+- Scorecard statistics are correct
+- _READY file format acceptable for ops dashboard
+
+---
+
+## Production Deployment (Monday)
+
+### 1. Pre-deployment
+- [ ] Confirm all staging tests passed
+- [ ] Backup current Airflow database
+- [ ] Schedule deployment during off-peak hours
+- [ ] Have rollback procedure ready
+
+### 2. Deploy
+```bash
+# Stop current Airflow processes
+airflow scheduler stop  # or kill process
+airflow webserver stop  # or kill process
+
+# Update packages
+pip install --upgrade -r requirements.txt
+
+# Verify installation
+python -c "import airflow; print(airflow.__version__)"  # Should show 3.3.2
+
+# Restart Airflow
+airflow webserver -D
+airflow scheduler -D
+sleep 5
+
+# Verify DAGs loaded
+airflow dags list | grep -E "(ingest_shipments|carrier_scorecard)"
+```
+
+### 3. Post-deployment verification
+```bash
+# Monitor first few runs
+airflow dags test ingest_shipments --execution-date 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
+airflow dags test carrier_scorecard --execution-date 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
+
+# Check Airflow logs for any errors
+tail -f logs/ingest_shipments/*/ingest_shipments.log
+tail -f logs/carrier_scorecard/*/carrier_scorecard.log
+```
+
+### 4. Verify data flow
+- [ ] Ingest DAG creates batch files
+- [ ] Scorecard DAG triggers on dataset update
+- [ ] _READY file present with correct format
+- [ ] No errors in Airflow UI
+- [ ] Ops dashboard reflects new scorecards
+
+---
+
+## Rollback Procedure (If Issues Occur)
+
+### Step 1: Identify issue
+- Check Airflow logs for errors
+- Verify batch files created
+- Check scorecard output format
+
+### Step 2: Stop current version
+```bash
+airflow scheduler stop
+airflow webserver stop
+```
+
+### Step 3: Rollback code
+```bash
+git revert HEAD --no-edit
+```
+
+### Step 4: Downgrade packages
+```bash
+pip install apache-airflow==2.11.2
+```
+
+### Step 5: Restart and verify
+```bash
+airflow webserver -D
+airflow scheduler -D
+sleep 5
+
+# Force DAG re-registration
+airflow dags pause ingest_shipments
+airflow dags unpause ingest_shipments
+airflow dags pause carrier_scorecard
+airflow dags unpause carrier_scorecard
+```
+
+### Step 6: Monitor
+```bash
+# Test a run
+airflow dags test ingest_shipments --execution-date 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
+airflow dags test carrier_scorecard --execution-date 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
+```
+
+### Step 7: Report
+- Document what failed
+- Plan fix for next migration attempt
+- Consider compatibility testing in staging
+
+---
+
+## Known Issues & Mitigations
+
+### Issue 1: XCom deserialization
+**Symptom**: XCom watermark returns None when it shouldn't
+**Mitigation**: Already handled - string values deserialize automatically in 3.3
+
+### Issue 2: DAG not appearing in UI
+**Symptom**: DAGs don't show up after deployment
+**Mitigation**: Pause and unpause both DAGs to force re-registration
+
+### Issue 3: Task parameter not injected
+**Symptom**: `data_interval_end` is None in @task
+**Mitigation**: Already fixed - parameters are required (not optional)
+
+### Issue 4: Dataset trigger not working
+**Symptom**: carrier_scorecard doesn't auto-trigger
+**Mitigation**: Dataset URI unchanged; verify ingest_shipments completed successfully
+
+---
+
+## Monitoring & Alerts
+
+Set up alerts for:
+- [ ] Ingest job failure (batch file not created)
+- [ ] Watermark not advancing (stuck at same value)
+- [ ] Scorecard aggregation errors (CSV format change)
+- [ ] _READY file missing or wrong format
+
+Contact: logistics-data ops team (owner field in DAG)
+
+---
+
+## Questions?
+
+Refer to:
+- **MIGRATION_NOTES.md** - Technical migration details
+- **dags/ingest_shipments.py** - Commented source code
+- **dags/carrier_scorecard.py** - Commented source code
+- **Airflow 3.3 Changelog** - https://airflow.apache.org/docs/apache-airflow/3.3.0/release_notes.html
+
